// Placement (WP6.2, docs/rules/buildings.md "Placement"): two bases on the 256 by 256
// cell playfield (assets/maps/playfield256) build with BuildStructure, one command per
// tick. Since WP6.3 a structure that is built goes up first (docs/rules/construction.md):
// it is a prerequisite only once it is complete, so the chain below waits for it: the
// frozen definitions build a power plant in 300 ticks, a barracks in 400, a refinery in
// 800 and a vehicle factory in 1000. The refusals are the ones of WP6.2 and the ticks
// they happen on moved only where a command had to wait for a build to finish. Every refusal a scenario can reach refuses something at least once; the ones
// that need a malformed setup (UnknownKind, NoBuildingRules, NoFaction) are covered by
// the sf_sim tests (crates/sf_sim/tests/placement.rs).
// CI runs it on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in placement.expected;
// tools/sf_headless/tests/placement.rs asserts, tick by tick, which build stood and why
// each other one was refused.
//
// `unit_defs` names a directory next to this file with a FROZEN copy of the unit
// definitions (a copy of the shipped files at the time of WP6.2). `buildings` gives the
// world the building rules of that copy, `factions` says who is which faction.
// Kinds are the permanent numbers of the records (docs/rules/buildings.md): 0
// construction_center, 1 power_plant, 2 refinery, 3 barracks, 4 vehicle_factory, 9
// decoy_emplacement, 10 fortified_bunker, 12 rifleman.
//
// Meridian (player 0): anchor on (22, 44), a rock patch on x 14 to 17, y 44 to 49.
// Veyran (player 1): anchor on (100, 36). Both anchors are PLACED (PlaceStructure, as a
// mission places its start state): the anchor cannot be built.
Scenario(
    name: "placement",
    seed: 0x5EED_0062,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    map_name: Some("playfield256"),
    unit_defs: Some("placement_defs"),
    buildings: true,
    factions: [(0, Meridian), (1, Veyran)],
    ticks: 2110,
    commands: [
        // --- the start state ---
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 0, owner: 0, cell: (22, 44))),
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 0, owner: 1, cell: (100, 36))),
        // A rifleman of Meridian standing on (30, 44).
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (30, 44))),
        // --- the first ticks: Meridian ---
        // 1: goes up (gap 4 from the anchor); complete after tick 301.
        (tick: 1, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (30, 40))),
        // 2: refused, the power plant would stand on the rock patch.
        (tick: 2, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (16, 44))),
        // 3: refused, the same cells as 1 (a structure under construction takes its cells).
        (tick: 3, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (30, 41))),
        // 4: refused, the rifleman stands on (30, 44).
        (tick: 4, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (29, 44))),
        // 5: refused, 20 cells east of the anchor's edge.
        (tick: 5, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (46, 44))),
        // 6: refused, the vehicle factory needs a refinery.
        (tick: 6, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 4, cell: (19, 40))),
        // 7: refused, the refinery needs the power plant and the plant of 1 is only going up.
        (tick: 7, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 2, cell: (22, 49))),
        // 12: refused, the anchor cannot be built.
        (tick: 12, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 0, cell: (30, 36))),
        // --- the first ticks: Veyran ---
        // 13: goes up; complete after tick 313.
        (tick: 13, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (108, 36))),
        // 14: refused, the plant is going up.
        (tick: 14, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 3, cell: (104, 42))),
        // 15: refused, the decoy is Meridian's to build.
        (tick: 15, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 9, cell: (106, 42))),
        // 17: refused, the Meridian base is 66 cells from the Veyran anchor.
        (tick: 17, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (34, 44))),
        // 18: refused, the plant's second column would be x 256, off the 256-cell map.
        (tick: 18, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (255, 36))),
        // 20: a mission object: a Veyran decoy PLACED at (60, 100), far from both bases: no faction,
        // no radius, and complete at once.
        (tick: 20, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 9, owner: 1, cell: (60, 100))),
        // --- waiting for the builds ---
        // 300: refused still, one tick before the plant is complete.
        (tick: 300, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 2, cell: (22, 49))),
        // 301: the plant completes in this tick; the refinery (complete after tick 1101) and the
        // barracks (complete after tick 701) go up in it.
        (tick: 301, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 2, cell: (22, 49))),
        (tick: 301, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 3, cell: (26, 49))),
        // 313: the Veyran plant is complete: the barracks goes up (complete after tick 713).
        (tick: 313, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 3, cell: (104, 42))),
        // 702: the Meridian decoy on the barracks (complete after tick 862).
        (tick: 702, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 9, cell: (30, 48))),
        // 703: the Veyran bunker, refused for Meridian.
        (tick: 703, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 10, cell: (31, 48))),
        // 704: refused, the barracks' exit cell (30, 48) is under the decoy of 702.
        (tick: 704, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 3, cell: (28, 47))),
        // 714: the Veyran player's own bunker.
        (tick: 714, player: 1, command: BuildStructure(kind: 10, cell: (106, 42))),
        // 1102: the vehicle factory, now that the refinery stands; its exit cell is (22, 42).
        (tick: 1102, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 4, cell: (19, 40))),
    ],
)
